  "steps": [
    "Add the fennel seeds, cumin seeds, coriander seeds and black peppercorns to a mortar and pestle. Crush coarsely.",
    "Heat 1 tsp oil in a pan. Add the crushed whole spices and sauté until aromatic.",
    "Crush the green chillies and garlic together into a coarse mixture. Add to the pan and sauté briefly.",
    "Add the boiled and squeezed soya granules and cook for 3 to 4 minutes.",
    "Add the boiled potato and mix well with the soya granules and spices. Add the boiled peas and sauté everything together.",
    "Add the kasuri methi, garam masala, black pepper, dry mango powder, salt and black salt. Mix well.",
    "Mash the mixture until it comes together, leaving some peas slightly intact.",
    "Mix cornflour with a little water to make a smooth slurry for sealing.",
    "Cut each tortilla in half. Add the filling in middle and fold each corner towards the mide, and seal the edges firmly with the cornflour slurry making a triangle.",
    "Spray oil on top and Air-fry at 160°C for 7 to 10 minutes, flipping halfway through, until crispy.",
    "Serve hot with green chutney."
  ],
